<button id="clear">?唳?隞?/button>
<div class="settings-wrap"><button id="settings-toggle" aria-expanded="false">閮剖? ??/button><div id="settings-menu" hidden><button id="save">?脣?</button><button id="open">????隞?/button><button id="md">?臬 MD</button><button id="preview">?皜脫??砍?</button><button id="settings-explorer" type="button">EXPLORER嚗???</button><button id="settings-text-tools" type="button">?撌亙</button></div></div>
<input id="insert-image-file" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><input id="file" type="file" accept=".ainote,.json,.html,.htm,.md,.markdown,.txt" hidden>
</div></div>
</header>
<div class="workspace"><aside id="explorer"><div class="explorer-title">EXPLORER <button id="cloud-page-toggle" type="button" title="???脩垢撠??" aria-label="???脩垢撠??">???脩垢</button></div><div class="root-toolbar"><button id="root-open">?詨??砍?辣憭?/button><button id="sider-close">CloseSider</button></div><div id="root-label">撠?詨? Root</div><div class="explorer-actions"><button id="add-fold">+Fold</button><button id="add-file">+File</button><button id="root-save">Save</button><button id="root-close">Close</button><button id="explorer-operate" aria-haspopup="true">Operate ??/button></div><div id="inline-name" hidden></div><div id="tree"></div><div id="sider-resizer" role="separator" aria-label="隤踵 Explorer 撖砍漲" aria-orientation="vertical" tabindex="0"></div></aside><main><div class="editor-topbar"><button id="sider-edge" aria-label="?? Explorer" title="?? Explorer">??/button><div id="mode-indicator"></div></div>
<article id="editor" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" data-gramm="false" data-gramm_editor="false" aria-label="?辣蝺刻摩?" data-placeholder="?湔鞎潔? ChatGPT ?批捆??Markdown嚗??喲＊蝷箸?????>
</article>
</main><section id="cloud-page" hidden><div class="cloud-shell"><h2>?脩垢撠?</h2><p class="cloud-muted">?砍 Explorer ?蝡航????典??ｇ??脩垢??銝??湔閬??砍瑼???/p><div id="cloud-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="cloud-progress" class="cloud-progress" hidden><div class="cloud-progress-info"><span id="cloud-progress-label">皞?銝凌?/span><span id="cloud-progress-percent">0%</span></div><progress id="cloud-progress-bar" max="100" value="0"></progress></div><div id="cloud-create-panel" class="cloud-panel" hidden><h3>撱箇??脩垢 Fold ZIP</h3><label>靽???<select id="cloud-life-days"><option value="1">1 day</option><option value="7" selected>7 days</option><option value="14">14 days</option><option value="30">30 days</option><option value="90">90 days</option></select></label><div class="cloud-actions"><button id="cloud-create-confirm">撱箇?銝虫???/button><button id="cloud-create-cancel">??</button></div></div><div id="cloud-commit-panel" class="cloud-panel" hidden><h3>?漱?脩垢 Root ZIP</h3><p id="cloud-commit-target"></p><label><input type="radio" name="cloud-commit-mode" value="incremental" checked> 憓??漱嚗摰寞?寡?銝遣蝡?嚗?/label><label><input type="radio" name="cloud-commit-mode" value="full"> 摰?漱嚗遣蝡??湔?嚗?/label><div id="cloud-commit-life" hidden><label>摰?漱敺?摮???select id="cloud-commit-life-days"><option value="1">1 day</option><option value="7" selected>7 days</option><option value="14">14 days</option><option value="30">30 days</option><option value="90">90 days</option></select></label></div><div class="cloud-actions"><button id="cloud-commit-confirm" type="button">蝣箄??漱</button><button id="cloud-commit-cancel" type="button">??</button></div></div><div class="cloud-panel"><h3>???脩垢?辣</h3><div class="cloud-actions"><input id="cloud-search-input" placeholder="?撓?亙???File Hash ID嚗UID嚗?><button id="cloud-search-button">Search</button></div><div class="cloud-table-wrap"><table id="cloud-file-table"><thead><tr><th>?辣??/th><th>File Hash ID</th><th>Commit ??</th><th>?唳???</th><th>?漱摨?</th><th>??</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div><div class="cloud-panel"><h3>?漱甇瑕</h3><div id="cloud-history">隢銝?豢??辣隞交??Commit 蝝??/div></div><input id="cloud-import-file" type="file" accept=".zip,.md,.txt" hidden></div></section></div><div id="context-menu" hidden></div><div id="cloud-operations" role="menu" aria-label="?脩垢?嗅??" hidden><button id="cloud-import-button" type="button" role="menuitem">敺蝡臬??亥 Explorer</button><button id="cloud-zip-button" type="button" role="menuitem">銝??脩垢撠? ZIP</button></div>
<footer>Ctrl+V 鞎潔??? / ?? 繚 Ctrl+S ?脣? 繚 ?舀??? 繚 ????摮?頛?雿輻 Markdown ??蝣?/footer>
